icture okay it's not the  website that you envisioned  you're making progress towards it  because if the idea is just sitting in  your head  and you never do anything about it it's  just going to die with you  and i don't want that for you i want you  to see this thing happen  so you're dreaming big you've got this  big plan for what you want to have  happen with your company but you got to  start small  and not wait on anything don't wait on  anybody else don't wait on money to come  in don't wait on  the media to find you don't wait on  anything there's nothing holding you  back  start something today and then tomorrow  do something else and the next day do  something else  no matter how small just to make sure  that momentum is happening  for your business if you do that every  day  you'll be shocked at how far you've come  and you'll start attracting the right  people to your company to help you  scale this thing to eventually become  the business that you want it to be  believe for those of you watching you  like the video please give it a thumbs  up below i love seeing those come in and  please leave a comment underneath they  really make my day  every time i see them i'd love to hear  from you have a question leave it below  thank you so much and i'll see you soon
 

